<title>UK: GMAC sets C$100 million bond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>GMAC sets C$100 million bond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GMAC CANADA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.78    PAY DATE   S12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.205   SPREAD	+62 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
